      id: "wt07", live: true, incident: "Comments shipped on Monday. The database does <b>80 queries a second</b> and now gets <b>120</b>. Someone adds read replicas, pages are fast again, and by Tuesday support has forty tickets: <i>“I posted a comment and it vanished.”</i>", title: "The database is the bottleneck", curve: "lag", law: "replication lag",
